-afternoon sunlight.\n\noverall_soundscape: Rapid footfalls strike concrete in sync with the running rhythm. Wind rushes strongly around the microphone during the jump, with clothing and harness straps fluttering. Shoe soles scrape against the rooftop edge and metal rail, followed by a solid landing impact and the runner's brief exerted breathing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Fast electronic breakbeat at approximately  es 140 BPM, driven by tight kick drums, sharp hi-hats, and a pulsing bass synth. The rhythm intensifies during the jump and drops slightly on the final landing.", 1344, 768, 124, "Ref2VA — 参考生音视频", "native", 1, false, 0, true, "match", "official_2_to_15s"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 303, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "video_vae", "link": 304, "label": "video_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "video_vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 305, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "drive_audio", "label": "drive_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "drive_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "final_audio", "label": "final_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "final_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 345, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "link": 347, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "label": "ref_images.ref_image_2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "label": "ref_videos.ref_video_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_video_0"}, {"shape": 7, "nam